></p><p><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体;\\\">1.乐园岛每周仅在周四接待访客；</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体;\\\">2.乐园岛不欢迎失约之人，若访客未能按时赴约，将永久失去访问资格；</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体;\\\">3.访客行动范围仅限于【会客区】，需在至少一名狱警的陪同下进行参观；</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体;\\\">4.访客拜访时间为15时至18时，逾期将面临未知后果；</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体;\\\">5.访客必须全程佩戴专属手环，手环为唯一通讯设备；</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体;\\\">6.访客不得擅自进入【禁闭区】或【囚犯区】，违者将被视为违规；</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体;\\\">7.访客不得携带任何外来通讯设备，违规将被没收并记录在案；</spa', NULL, 1, '\n### Error updating database.  Cause: com.mysql.cj.jdbc.exceptions.MysqlDataTruncation: Data truncation: Data too long for column \'summary\' at row 1\n### The error may exist in URL [jar:file:/home/admin/AshEchoesAdmin.jar!/BOOT-INF/classes!/mybatis/system/StoryBackMapper.xml]\n### The error may involve com.ruoyi.project.system.mapper.StoryBackMapper.insertStoryBack-Inline\n### The error occurred while setting parameters\n### SQL: insert into story_back          ( origin_id,             sort,              parent_id,              banner,             title,             type,             chars,             s_time,             world,             author,             `desc`,             summary,             otext,             create_time,             update_time,             create_by,             update_by )           values ( ?,             ?,              ?,              ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ? )\n### Cause: com.mysql.cj.jdbc.exceptions.MysqlDataTruncation: Data truncation: Data too long for column \'summary\' at row 1\n; Data truncation: Data too long for column \'summary\' at row 1; nested exception is com.mysql.cj.jdbc.exceptions.MysqlDataTruncation: Data truncation: Data too long for column \'summary\' at row 1', '2025-02-20 10:27:43', 97);
